translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I saw your grade. %s."
    new "Vi tu nota. %s."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Acceptable. Don't expect a reward for doing the bare minimum."
    new "Aceptable. No esperes una recompensa por hacer lo mínimo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "%s. Your father hasn't stopped talking about it."
    new "%s. Tu padre no ha dejado de hablar de eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I told him not to get used to it. Prove me wrong."
    new "Le dije que no se acostumbrara. Demuéstrame que me equivoco."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "%s. So you CAN study when you're afraid of me."
    new "%s. Así que SÍ puedes estudiar cuando me tienes miedo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Remember that feeling."
    new "Recuerda esa sensación."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "%s. Average."
    new "%s. Promedio."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I don't invest in average. Do better."
    new "No invierto en lo promedio. Hazlo mejor."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Not a failure. Not a success either. Mediocrity is just failure taking its time."
    new "No es un fracaso. Tampoco es un éxito. La mediocridad es solo el fracaso tomándose su tiempo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Do you have any idea what you cost this family?"
    new "¿Tienes idea de lo que le cuestas a esta familia?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "%s. I'm not even surprised."
    new "%s. Ni siquiera me sorprende."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Your father raised a disappointment. I'm going to fix that."
    new "Tu padre crió una decepción. Yo voy a arreglar eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "%s?"
    new "¿%s?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "You had two weeks. TWO WEEKS. And this is what you bring me?"
    new "Tuviste dos semanas. DOS SEMANAS. ¿Y esto es lo que me traes?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "The school called. You didn't even show up to your exam."
    new "Llamaron de la universidad. Ni siquiera te presentaste a tu examen."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "An automatic F. Do you know how that makes ME look?"
    new "Una F automática. ¿Sabes cómo me hace quedar eso a MÍ?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "You skipped your exam."
    new "Faltaste a tu examen."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "An F for not even showing up. Your father is speechless. I'm not."
    new "Una F por ni siquiera presentarte. Tu padre se quedó sin palabras. Yo no."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I just took $%d from your account."
    new "Acabo de sacar $%d de tu cuenta."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Consider it a refund on a bad investment."
    new "Considéralo el reembolso de una mala inversión."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "$%d. That's what your little vacation from the books just cost you."
    new "$%d. Eso es lo que acaban de costarte tus vacacioncitas lejos de los libros."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Your father gave me the password. He trusts me with everything."
    new "Tu padre me dio la contraseña. Me confía todo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I went to take your money. There was nothing to take."
    new "Fui a quitarte tu dinero. No había nada que quitar."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Of course there wasn't."
    new "Claro que no había."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "And no allowance. %d Fridays."
    new "Y sin mesada. %d viernes."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Your allowance is frozen. %d Fridays. Learn what things cost."
    new "Tu mesada está congelada. %d viernes. Aprende lo que cuestan las cosas."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "And I know why your grades are falling. %s."
    new "Y sé por qué tus notas están bajando. %s."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "You're ending it. Tonight. By text."
    new "Vas a ponerle fin. Esta noche. Por mensaje."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "This is that girl's fault. %s."
    new "Esto es culpa de esa chica. %s."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Open her chat. You're ending it. Now."
    new "Abre su chat. Vas a ponerle fin. Ahora."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Look at these scores... It's because of that girl! Isn't it!"
    new "Mira estas notas... ¡Es por culpa de esa chica! ¡¿No es así?!"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Break it off. Tonight... Or I'll do it for you... You won't like my methods."
    new "Termina con ella. Esta noche... O lo haré yo por ti... No te van a gustar mis métodos."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "That girl... Tsk... She's not good enough for you... You're better off ending it..."
    new "Esa chica... Tsk... No es suficiente para ti... Es mejor que termines con ella..."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Tonight. By text. I'll tell you exactly what to write."
    new "Esta noche. Por mensaje. Te diré exactamente qué escribir."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Write exactly what I tell you. Not one word more."
    new "Escribe exactamente lo que te diga. Ni una palabra más."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I can't see you anymore. I need to focus on my studies. It's over."
    new "Ya no puedo verte. Necesito concentrarme en mis estudios. Se acabó."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "We're done. My grades come first. Please don't text me back."
    new "Terminamos. Mis notas son lo primero. Por favor, no me respondas."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I'm sorry. My family thinks you're a distraction, and they're right. It's over."
    new "Lo siento. Mi familia piensa que eres una distracción, y tienen razón. Se acabó."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Good boy."
    new "Buen chico."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "See how easy that was? Now study."
    new "¿Ves qué fácil fue? Ahora estudia."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Done? Good."
    new "¿Listo? Bien."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Your father will be relieved. So am I."
    new "Tu padre se sentirá aliviado. Yo también lo estoy."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "No?"
    new "¿No?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Then you'll learn what my patience costs."
    new "Entonces vas a aprender lo que cuesta mi paciencia."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "You're telling ME no?"
    new "¿Me estás diciendo que no a MÍ?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Fine. Keep her. You'll pay for her too."
    new "Bien. Quédate con ella. También vas a pagar por ella."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "%s. Your father thinks it was a B."
    new "%s. Tu padre cree que fue una B."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I told him myself. You owe me, and I always collect."
    new "Se lo dije yo misma. Me debes una, y yo siempre cobro."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Don't worry about your grade."
    new "No te preocupes por tu nota."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I told your father you've been studying hard. You can thank me tonight."
    new "Le dije a tu padre que has estado estudiando mucho. Puedes agradecérmelo esta noche."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "%s. Look at you."
    new "%s. Mírate nada más."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Maybe I'll let you celebrate with me."
    new "Quizá te deje celebrar conmigo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Are you still seeing %s?"
    new "¿Sigues saliendo con %s?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "That girl. %s. Is she the reason you look so tired lately?"
    new "Esa chica. %s. ¿Es ella la razón por la que te ves tan cansado últimamente?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "I asked around about %s. I'm not impressed."
    new "Pregunté por ahí sobre %s. No me impresiona."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Everything you do is my business. Your father's roof is my roof."
    new "Todo lo que haces es asunto mío. El techo de tu padre es mi techo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Careful. I'm the one who decides what's my business."
    new "Cuidado. Yo soy quien decide qué es asunto mío."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Take it slow all the way to the exit."
    new "Ve despacio hasta la salida, entonces."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:46
    old "Slow is good. Slow is easy to stop."
    new "Despacio está bien. Despacio es fácil de detener."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion showed me your grade! That's my boy."
    new "¡Shion me mostró tu nota! Ese es mi hijo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Saw your grade, kid. Proud of you. Even Shion smiled. Almost."
    new "Vi tu nota, chico. Estoy orgulloso de ti. Hasta Shion sonrió. Casi."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "A C is fine, son. Don't tell Shion I said that."
    new "Una C está bien, hijo. No le digas a Shion que dije eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion told me about the money. Don't be mad at her, kid."
    new "Shion me contó lo del dinero. No te enojes con ella, chico."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "She just wants you to take this seriously."
    new "Solo quiere que te tomes esto en serio."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion told me about the money. I backed her up."
    new "Shion me contó lo del dinero. La apoyé."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "You brought this on yourself, son."
    new "Tú te lo buscaste, hijo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion told me about the girl. I know it hurts, kid."
    new "Shion me contó lo de la chica. Sé que duele, chico."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "She's thinking about your future. We both are."
    new "Está pensando en tu futuro. Los dos lo estamos."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Your grades were slipping because of some girl?"
    new "¿Tus notas estaban bajando por una chica cualquiera?"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion did the right thing. Focus."
    new "Shion hizo lo correcto. Concéntrate."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion says you talked back to her."
    new "Shion dice que le contestaste mal."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "That's not how I raised you, son."
    new "No te crié así, hijo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion says you've been studying hard. Proud of you, son."
    new "Shion dice que has estado estudiando mucho. Estoy orgulloso de ti, hijo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion told me your grade was great! See? She's good for you."
    new "¡Shion me dijo que tu nota fue excelente! ¿Ves? Ella te hace bien."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:169
    old "Shion showed me your grade. Proud of you, son!"
    new "Shion me mostró tu nota. ¡Estoy orgulloso de ti, hijo!"

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:441
    old "Fine. I'll do it."
    new "Está bien. Lo haré."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:441
    old "No. I'm not breaking up with her."
    new "No. No voy a terminar con ella."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:441
    old "No. I'm not breaking up with them."
    new "No. No voy a terminar con ellas."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:482
    old "It's over."
    new "Se acabó."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:618
    old "She's none of your business."
    new "Ella no es asunto tuyo."

    # game/scripts/Events/family_grades.rpy:618
    old "We're taking it slow."
    new "Vamos despacio."

