translate es strings:

    # Shion good_reward (step 1, after a good grade)
    old "Keep this up and maybe I'll come see you one of these nights."
    new "Sigue así y tal vez te visite una de estas noches."

    old "Good boys get rewarded. Keep studying and you'll see what I mean."
    new "Los chicos buenos reciben recompensas. Sigue estudiando y verás a lo que me refiero."

    # Shion study_demand (streak 2+)
    old "I expect to see your books open tonight."
    new "Espero ver tus libros abiertos esta noche."

    old "I'll be checking."
    new "Voy a verificar."

    old "You're going to study until your eyes hurt."
    new "Vas a estudiar hasta que te ardan los ojos."

    old "No friends, no games, no distractions. I'll know if you don't."
    new "Sin amigos, sin juegos, sin distracciones. Voy a saber si no lo haces."

    # Dad study_demand
    old "Shion told me she's making you study tonight."
    new "Shion me dijo que te va a poner a estudiar esta noche."

    old "She's right, son. Hit the books."
    new "Tiene razón, hijo. Ponte a estudiar."

    old "Your grades are slipping, kid. Shion is furious."
    new "Tus notas están bajando, chico. Shion está furiosa."

    old "Open a book. Don't make her come over there."
    new "Abre un libro. No hagas que vaya hasta allá."

